如果我没记错的话，那是全世界最快的火车。
then you change onto the TGV,
which is the fastest train
in the world, I think.

36
00:02:15,480 --> 00:02:18,080
一路喝着金汤力，舒舒服服直奔法国南部海岸。
All the way to the south coast of France
