那些——不！
那些火车确实神了，
Those - no!
Those trains are incredible,

39
00:02:21,000 --> 00:02:24,320
时速186英里，而且有人认为
186 miles an hour,
and some people reckon

40
00:02:24,360 --> 00:02:29,400
去法国南部坐高铁其实比坐飞机还快，
更别提自己开车了。
it's actually a quicker way
to the south of France than
a plane, let alone a car.

41
00:02:29,440 --> 00:02:30,760
