Rubbish. No train can
be faster than cars.

44
00:02:35,200 --> 00:02:36,880
绝无可能，听懂没？
Not possible. Okay?

45
00:02:36,920 --> 00:02:40,640
为了证明这一点，
我组织了一场史诗级对决。
And to prove the point,
I organised an epic race.

46
00:02:40,680 --> 00:02:44,160
路线是这样的：
我们早上八点集合，
This was the route.
We were going to meet
at 8:00 in the morning

47
00:02:44,200 --> 00:02:46,840
就在萨里郡中心的演播室，
here at the studio
in the middle of Surrey,

48
00:02:46,880 --> 00:02:50,760
然后一路狂飙
杀向法国南部，明白吗？
and then we would race
to the south of France. Okay?

49
00:02:50,800 --> 00:02:53,880
他们俩会去坐
所谓的飞速高铁，
Now, they would be on
one of their very fast trains,

50
00:02:53,920 --> 00:02:57,320
而我，
则开一辆飞速跑车。
and I would be
in a very fast car.

51
00:02:57,360 --> 00:02:59,680
开哪辆？答案显而易见。
Which one? That's obvious.

52
00:02:59,720 --> 00:03:02,000
全新阿斯顿·马丁 DB9。
The new Aston Martin DB9.

53
00:03:02,020 --> 00:03:05,020
♪ The Cinematic Orchestra -
All That You Give ♪
♪ The Cinematic Orchestra -
All That You Give ♪

54
